<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-plan-task="{{task}}" data-plan-status="待确认" data-flow-status="待确认" data-confirmed-by="" data-confirmed-at="">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{task}} · 方案确认</title>
<style>
  :root { --bg:#f5f5f5; --card:#fff; --line:#f0f0f0; --fg:rgba(0,0,0,.88); --dim:rgba(0,0,0,.65);
          --faint:rgba(0,0,0,.45); --primary:#1677ff; --ok:#52c41a; --warn:#faad14; --bad:#ff4d4f; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; padding:24px 16px 48px; background:var(--bg); color:var(--fg);
         font:14px/1.5714 -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  header, section { background:var(--card); border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.03); padding:16px 24px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  h1 { font-size:20px; margin:0 0 8px; }
  h2 { font-size:16px; margin:0 0 10px; }
  .meta { color:var(--dim); margin:0 0 4px; }
  .meta b { color:var(--fg); font-weight:600; }
  ul, ol { margin:0; padding-left:20px; }
  li { margin:2px 0; }
  code { background:rgba(0,0,0,.06); border-radius:4px; padding:0 4px; font-size:12px; }
  a { color:var(--primary); text-decoration:none; }
  .tag { display:inline-block; padding:0 8px; height:22px; line-height:20px; border-radius:4px;
         border:1px solid #ffe58f; background:#fffbe6; color:#d48806; font-size:12px; }
  .tag.is-ok { border-color:#b7eb8f; background:#f6ffed; color:#389e0d; }
  .hint { color:var(--faint); font-size:13px; margin-top:6px; }
  .gate { border-left:3px solid var(--warn); }
  .gate.is-ok { border-left-color: var(--ok); }
  .flow-row { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin:10px 0 12px; }
  .flow-node { display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px;
               background:#fafafa; font-size:13px; }
  .flow-arrow { color:var(--faint); }
  .doc-modal { position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:10000; background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);
               display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:24px; }
  .doc-modal.is-open { display:flex; }
  .doc-dialog { width:min(900px,94vw); height:min(760px,90vh); background:#fff; color:var(--fg);
                border-radius:10px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; overflow:hidden;
                box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
  .doc-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:10px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .doc-head b { font-size:14px; }
  .doc-head .spacer { flex:1; }
  .doc-head a, .doc-head button { font:inherit; font-size:12px; color:var(--primary); background:none;
                                  border:0; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none; }
  .doc-body { flex:1; overflow:auto; padding:20px 24px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; }
  .doc-body h1, .doc-body h2, .doc-body h3 { margin:18px 0 8px; }
  .doc-body h1 { font-size:20px; } .doc-body h2 { font-size:17px; } .doc-body h3 { font-size:15px; }
  .doc-body pre { background:#f6f8fa; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; padding:12px;
                  overflow:auto; font-size:12px; }
  .doc-body code { background:rgba(0,0,0,.06); border-radius:4px; padding:1px 4px; font-size:12px; }
  .doc-body pre code { background:none; padding:0; }
  .doc-body table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:10px 0; font-size:13px; }
  .doc-body th, .doc-body td { border:1px solid var(--line); padding:6px 8px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; }
  .doc-body blockquote { margin:10px 0; padding:6px 12px; border-left:3px solid var(--line); color:var(--dim); }
  .doc-loading { color:var(--faint); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <header>
    <h1>{{task}} · 方案确认</h1>
    <p class="meta">用户原话：<b>{{userWords}}</b></p>
    <p class="meta">
      状态：<span class="tag" data-plan-status-label>待确认</span>
      · 确认人：<b data-confirmed-by-label>—</b>
      · 确认时间：<b data-confirmed-at-label>—</b>
    </p>
    <p class="hint">
      本页由 <code>dsh-plugin-harness-cli plan {{task}}</code> 生成。**确认之前不要开工**：
      step 进度大于 0 或任务状态不是「进行中」时，校验会要求本页状态为「已确认」。
      确认命令：<code>dsh-plugin-harness-cli plan {{task}} --confirm --by "确认人"</code>。
    </p>
  </header>

  <section id="business-flow" data-section="business-flow">
    <h2>0. 业务流程图（先确认）</h2>
    <p class="hint">
      先把业务流程图对齐并确认，再做页面 / 交互、数据模型与 UI 设计及文档；
      流程图确认前不要把模板当成已定稿，提前生成的页面用骨架屏等待内容。
    </p>
    <div class="flow-row" data-flow-diagram>
      <span class="flow-node">开始</span><span class="flow-arrow">→</span>
      <span class="flow-node">待填：业务步骤</span><span class="flow-arrow">→</span>
      <span class="flow-node">结束</span>
    </div>
    <ul data-flow-list>
      <li>主流程：待填</li>
      <li>异常路径：待填</li>
      <li>状态流转：待填</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="meta">
      流程图源文件：<a href="../../{{paths.specs}}/{{task}}/flow.md" data-flow-preview>docs/specs/{{task}}/flow.md</a>（Mermaid，点击预览）
    </p>
    <p class="hint">
      业务流程图状态：<b data-flow-status-label>待确认</b>（随方案确认一起确认）
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="goal" data-section="goal">
    <h2>1. 需求原话与目标</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>原话：{{userWords}}</li>
      <li>目标（一句话，完成时能验证）：待填</li>
      <li>不做的事（非目标）：待填</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="approach" data-section="approach">
    <h2>2. 方案（DDD 边界 / SDD 契约）</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>限界上下文：待填（与 <code>docs/specs/{{task}}/design.md</code> 一致）</li>
      <li>核心方案：待填（分几步、每步产出什么）</li>
      <li>契约：待填（<code>S-01</code>、<code>S-02</code>…），详见 <a href="../../{{paths.specs}}/{{task}}/spec.md">spec.md</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="ui" data-section="ui">
    <h2>3. 页面设计（需要界面时先做这一节）</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>页面清单：待填（没有界面就写「本任务无界面」）</li>
      <li>关键状态：待填（加载 / 空 / 错误 / 无权限 / 成功）</li>
      <li>UI 稿：<a href="ui/index.html">ui/index.html</a>（未生成时先跑 <code>dsh-plugin-harness-cli ui {{task}}</code>）</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="hint">顺序固定：先页面设计，再流程交互；页面没定稿不要开始写交互。</p>
  </section>

  <section id="flow" data-section="flow">
    <h2>4. 流程与交互设计</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>主流程：待填（谁在什么时候做什么，系统怎么响应）</li>
      <li>异常路径：待填（失败 / 超时 / 并发冲突怎么走）</li>
      <li>状态流转：待填（哪些状态可以互转，谁触发）</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="risks" data-section="risks">
    <h2>5. 风险与边界</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>数据风险：待填</li>
      <li>依赖与外部系统：待填</li>
      <li>明确不做的：待填</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="accept" data-section="accept">
    <h2>6. 验收标准</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>待填：可机械核对的验收条目，逐条对应 <code>S-xx</code></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="confirm" class="gate" data-section="confirm">
    <h2>7. 确认</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>方案已与需求方确认</li>
      <li>页面设计 / 流程设计已确认（如涉及界面）</li>
      <li>风险与边界已确认</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="hint">
      确认后执行：<code>dsh-plugin-harness-cli plan {{task}} --confirm --by "确认人"</code>，
      再把任务页的状态改为「进行中」并开始推进进度。
    </p>
  </section>
</main>
<div class="doc-modal" id="flow-doc-modal" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="doc-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="业务流程图源文件">
    <div class="doc-head">
      <b>业务流程图源文件</b><span class="spacer"></span>
      <a id="flow-doc-open" href="../../{{paths.specs}}/{{task}}/flow.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">新窗口打开</a>
      <button type="button" id="flow-doc-close">关闭</button>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-body" id="flow-doc-body"><p class="doc-loading">加载中…</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
(function () {
  var trigger = document.querySelector('[data-flow-preview]');
  var modal = document.getElementById('flow-doc-modal');
  var body = document.getElementById('flow-doc-body');
  var close = document.getElementById('flow-doc-close');
  if (!trigger || !modal || !body) return;

  function esc(value) {
    return String(value).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');
  }
  function inline(value) {
    return esc(value)
      .replace(/`([^`]+)`/g, '<code>$1</code>')
      .replace(/\*\*([^*]+)\*\*/g, '<strong>$1</strong>')
      .replace(/\[([^\]]+)\]\(([^)]+)\)/g, '<a href="$2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">$1</a>');
  }
  function renderMarkdown(md) {
    var lines = md.replace(/\r\n/g, '\n').split('\n');
    var out = [], i = 0, inCode = false, code = [];
    while (i < lines.length) {
      var line = lines[i];
      if (/^```/.test(line)) {
        if (inCode) { out.push('<pre><code>' + esc(code.join('\n')) + '</code></pre>'); code = []; inCode = false; }
        else inCode = true;
        i += 1;
        continue;
      }
      if (inCode) { code.push(line); i += 1; continue; }
      if (/^\s*$/.test(line)) { i += 1; continue; }
      var heading = /^(#{1,4})\s+(.*)$/.exec(line);
      if (heading) {
        var level = heading[1].length;
        out.push('<h' + level + '>' + inline(heading[2]) + '</h' + level + '>');
        i += 1;
        continue;
      }
      if (/^[-*]\s+/.test(line)) {
        var items = [];
        while (i < lines.length && /^[-*]\s+/.test(lines[i])) {
          items.push('<li>' + inline(lines[i].replace(/^[-*]\s+/, '')) + '</li>');
          i += 1;
        }
        out.push('<ul>' + items.join('') + '</ul>');
        continue;
      }
      if (/^\d+\.\s+/.test(line)) {
        var numbered = [];
        while (i < lines.length && /^\d+\.\s+/.test(lines[i])) {
          numbered.push('<li>' + inline(lines[i].replace(/^\d+\.\s+/, '')) + '</li>');
          i += 1;
        }
        out.push('<ol>' + numbered.join('') + '</ol>');
        continue;
      }
      if (/^\|/.test(line)) {
        var rows = [];
        while (i < lines.length && /^\|/.test(lines[i])) { rows.push(lines[i]); i += 1; }
        var htmlRows = [];
        var header = true;
        for (var r = 0; r < rows.length; r += 1) {
          if (/^\|[\s|:-]+\|?$/.test(rows[r])) continue;
          var cells = rows[r].replace(/^\||\|$/g, '').split('|').map(function (cell) { return inline(cell.trim()); });
          var tag = header ? 'th' : 'td';
          htmlRows.push('<tr>' + cells.map(function (cell) { return '<' + tag + '>' + cell + '</' + tag + '>'; }).join('') + '</tr>');
          header = false;
        }
        out.push('<table>' + htmlRows.join('') + '</table>');
        continue;
      }
      if (/^>\s?/.test(line)) {
        out.push('<blockquote>' + inline(line.replace(/^>\s?/, '')) + '</blockquote>');
        i += 1;
        continue;
      }
      out.push('<p>' + inline(line) + '</p>');
      i += 1;
    }
    if (inCode && code.length) out.push('<pre><code>' + esc(code.join('\n')) + '</code></pre>');
    return out.join('\n');
  }

  function show(event) {
    event.preventDefault();
    modal.classList.add('is-open');
    modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
    body.innerHTML = '<p class="doc-loading">加载中…</p>';
    fetch(trigger.href, {cache: 'no-store'})
      .then(function (res) {
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error('HTTP ' + res.status);
        return res.text();
      })
      .then(function (text) { body.innerHTML = renderMarkdown(text); })
      .catch(function () {
        body.innerHTML = '<p>无法直接读取 Markdown（file:// 下浏览器会拦截）。</p>' +
          '<p><a href="' + trigger.href + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">在新窗口打开 flow.md</a></p>';
      });
  }
  function hide() {
    modal.classList.remove('is-open');
    modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
  }
  trigger.addEventListener('click', show);
  if (close) close.addEventListener('click', hide);
  modal.addEventListener('click', function (e) { if (e.target === modal) hide(); });
  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) { if (e.key === 'Escape') hide(); });
})();
</script>

<noscript><style>.hcli-skeleton{display:none!important}</style></noscript>
<style>
  .hcli-skeleton{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9998;background:#f5f5f5;padding:24px;box-sizing:border-box;
    transition:opacity .18s ease;overflow:hidden}
  .hcli-skeleton.is-hidden{opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none}
  .hcli-sk{border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ececec 25%,#f7f7f7 37%,#ececec 63%);
    background-size:400% 100%;animation:hcli-sk 1.15s ease infinite;margin-bottom:12px}
  @keyframes hcli-sk{0%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0 50%}}
  .hcli-sk-row{display:flex;gap:12px}
  .hcli-sk-row .hcli-sk{flex:1;margin-bottom:0}
</style>
<div class="hcli-skeleton" id="hcli-skeleton" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="hcli-sk" style="width:220px;height:26px"></div>
  <div class="hcli-sk" style="width:100%;height:52px"></div>
  <div class="hcli-sk-row">
    <div class="hcli-sk" style="height:120px"></div>
    <div class="hcli-sk" style="height:120px"></div>
    <div class="hcli-sk" style="height:120px"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hcli-sk" style="width:100%;height:180px"></div>
  <div class="hcli-sk" style="width:65%;height:18px"></div>
  <div class="hcli-sk" style="width:85%;height:18px"></div>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var el = document.getElementById('hcli-skeleton');
  if (!el) return;
  function hide() {
    el.classList.add('is-hidden');
    setTimeout(function(){ if (el.parentNode) el.parentNode.removeChild(el); }, 260);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'complete') setTimeout(hide, 300);
  else window.addEventListener('load', function(){ setTimeout(hide, 300); });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
